<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive">
    <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
    <title>Mark organization traffic</title>
    {% if standalone|default(false) %}
        {# Downloaded HTML bundles the source stylesheet to stay portable. #}
        <style>{% include '@styles/internal-traffic.css' %}</style>
    {% else %}
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('styles/internal-traffic.css') }}" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
    {% endif %}
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <h1>Mark organization traffic</h1>
    <p>Use this page to identify your browser as a team member’s browser in analytics reports. Nothing is written until you click the button.</p>
    {% include 'internal_traffic/marker.html.twig' %}
    <p>Reports store <code>{{ { (browser_config.name): true }|json_encode }}</code> for this marker. It identifies traffic from your organization, independently of navigation within a website.</p>
    <p>{% if browser_config.storage == 'cookie' %}The cookie lasts up to one year and applies to {{ browser_config.cookieDomain ? 'the domain ' ~ browser_config.cookieDomain ~ ' and its subdomains' : 'this hostname' }}. Browsers may clear it earlier.{% else %}Local storage applies only to this page’s exact origin (scheme, hostname and port), until it is removed or cleared.{% endif %}</p>
    <p>A page on the analytics host cannot mark an unrelated website. To mark another website, host this HTML page on that website and open it there. For sibling subdomains, a cookie with their shared parent domain can cover them together. Opening an HTML file directly from your downloads folder cannot mark a website.</p>
    {% if download_url %}
        <p><a class="download" href="{{ download_url }}" download="internal-traffic.html" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Download an HTML marker page</a></p>
        <p>The download contains the marker settings and no share token. Host it on each tracked site’s origin before sharing that site’s URL.</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p>This marker affects reporting only. It does not grant access to any account. Use each browser and device you want to mark.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
